OL,9,     FChocolate Box in Bournemouth. But
OL,10,     Fthe DIY drinks don't go down well.
OL,11,G1550 Four in a Bed
OL,12,     FThe final visit is to The Buckle
OL,13,     FSeaford in East Sussex, where B&B
OL,14,     Fnewbies Julie and Jason push the
OL,15,     Fboat out with seaside luxe. And
OL,16,     Fthe guests are blown away by the
OL,17,     Fbedrooms.
